# Input

```html
<p><span>label</span><img src="image.png" /><span>hint</span><b>x</b></p>

<p><span>label</span><input value="some value" /><span>hint</span></p>

```


# Options

```json
{
	"formatter": {
		"lineWidth": 40
	}
}
```

# Formatted

```html
<p>
	<span>label</span><img
		src="image.png"
	><span>hint</span><b>x</b>
</p>

<p>
	<span>label</span><input
		value="some value"
	><span>hint</span>
</p>

```
